{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "osougoyx5fvfy60g", "title": "108.基于P-Tuning微调模型", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"S7DPq\" id=\"S7DPq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">示例代码</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"localdoc\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fzip%2F2424104%2F1746582257262-2a404109-dcf7-4f50-af92-dd6df1299e42.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22prompt-causal.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A4833%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufd92155b-2aea-49a6-8813-4d9e1c624b8%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Aio5v%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"CbREh\" id=\"CbREh\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d7086c8\" id=\"u0d7086c8\" style=\"color: #000000\">前言</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua20db099\" id=\"ua20db099\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13c49aab\" id=\"u13c49aab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">Prompt 可以描述一个任务，或者提供您希望模型学习的任务示例。软提示方法不是手动创建这些 prompt，而是在输入嵌入中添加可学习的参数，这些参数可以针对特定任务进行优化，同时保持预训练模型的参数冻结。这使得为新的下游任务微调大型语言模型 (LLM) 变得更快、更容易。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u442c3c20\" id=\"u442c3c20\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50fe8e00\" id=\"u50fe8e00\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">PEFT 库支持多种类型的 prompt 方法（p-tuning、prefix tuning、prompt tuning），您可以在</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/prompting\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud0ca40fd\" id=\"ud0ca40fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u955d8c92\" id=\"u955d8c92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">软提示</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u576a3506\" id=\"u576a3506\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">指南中了解更多关于这些方法在概念上是如何工作的。如果您有兴趣将这些方法应用于其他任务和用例，请查看我们的</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/spaces/PEFT/soft-prompting\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3e4151e0\" id=\"u3e4151e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c6ec369\" id=\"u2c6ec369\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">notebook 合集</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u76d377b8\" id=\"u76d377b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u93ebe74f\" id=\"u93ebe74f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f2f897b\" id=\"u6f2f897b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">本指南将向您展示如何使用软提示方法训练因果语言模型，以</span><em><span data-lake-id=\"ua367f6a0\" id=\"ua367f6a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-500)\">生成分类</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u1315a48f\" id=\"u1315a48f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，判断推文是否为投诉。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua9c479c5\" id=\"ua9c479c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dd5cf83\" id=\"u1dd5cf83\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">熟悉训练因果语言模型的一般过程将非常有帮助，并使您能够专注于软提示方法。如果您是新手，我们建议您首先查看 Transformers 文档中的</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/tasks/language_modeling\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u255d0dbb\" id=\"u255d0dbb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc438198\" id=\"ucc438198\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">因果语言建模</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uafac7e98\" id=\"uafac7e98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">指南。当您准备好后，请返回查看将 PEFT 融入您的训练有多么容易！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u59ba5078\" id=\"u59ba5078\"><span data-lake-id=\"u791cbdb0\" id=\"u791cbdb0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">在开始之前，请确保您已安装所有必要的库。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8300878c\" id=\"u8300878c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f8e1c8a\" id=\"u7f8e1c8a\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">pip install -q peft transformers datasets</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u24b6dea8\" id=\"u24b6dea8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0641e739\" id=\"u0641e739\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">​</span><br></p><ul list=\"u4ca72077\"><li fid=\"uf4c2d78e\" data-lake-id=\"u94d03eed\" id=\"u94d03eed\"><code data-lake-id=\"u76c8ed5e\" id=\"u76c8ed5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d00c619\" id=\"u1d00c619\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">task_type</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0e504ddf\" id=\"u0e504ddf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">：要训练的任务类型（在本例中为序列到序列语言建模）条件生成任务，根据给定的输入（可能是文本、图片等）生成符合条件的输出。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uecfa116e\" id=\"uecfa116e\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub5201fb8\" id=\"ub5201fb8\" style=\"color: #000000\">SEQ_CLS</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u270a3965\" id=\"u270a3965\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"u960e40eb\" id=\"u960e40eb\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba3e8606\" id=\"uba3e8606\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">序列分类（Sequence Classification），对整个句子进行分类。如: 获取评论的情绪，检测电子邮件是否为垃圾邮件，确定句子在语法上是否正确或两个句子在逻辑上是否相关等</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"uc2c9411a\" id=\"uc2c9411a\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub13eddc5\" id=\"ub13eddc5\" style=\"color: #000000\">SEQ_2_SEQ_LM</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u31860fd1\" id=\"u31860fd1\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"u82233e91\" id=\"u82233e91\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50a3acb3\" id=\"u50a3acb3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">条件生成任务，根据给定的输入（可能是文本、图片等）生成符合条件的输出。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u230f0bf6\" id=\"u230f0bf6\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4eda1f5\" id=\"ud4eda1f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">与因果语言建模任务不同，条件生成不仅仅关注于给定上下文的连贯性，还关注于满足预定的任务要求。因果语言建模仅关注于根据给定的上下文生成文本序列。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u44d74e42\" id=\"u44d74e42\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01ceb28b\" id=\"u01ceb28b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">条件生成的应用包括但不限于机器翻译、文本摘要、图像描述等。这些任务通常需要模型在输入和输出之间建立复杂的映射关系。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"ueefbb421\" id=\"ueefbb421\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c97a64c\" id=\"u4c97a64c\" style=\"color: #000000\">CAUSAL_LM</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u486d4942\" id=\"u486d4942\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"ufac7e691\" id=\"ufac7e691\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe813558\" id=\"ufe813558\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">因果语言建模任务（CLM），在这种建模方法中，模型试图预测给定上下文中的下一个单词，该上下文通常包括在当前单词之前的所有单词。这种建模方法遵循因果原则，即当前单词只受到其前面单词的影响，而不受后面单词的影响。代表模型有 GPT2、Bloom、OPT、GPT-Neo、GPT-J、LLaMA、ChatGLM。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u3c2a78ea\" id=\"u3c2a78ea\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u72c9bcc1\" id=\"u72c9bcc1\" style=\"color: #000000\">TOKEN_CLS</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u637bb6fc\" id=\"u637bb6fc\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1e238e1e\" id=\"u1e238e1e\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a495676\" id=\"u7a495676\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">Token 分类任务（Token Classification），对句子中的每个词进行分类。如: 识别句子的语法成分（名词、动词、形容词）或命名实体（人、地点、组织）。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"ufa700cbb\" id=\"ufa700cbb\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"sCshJ\" id=\"sCshJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35f70c70\" id=\"u35f70c70\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">数据集</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u1052db88\" id=\"u1052db88\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1b2ab8c\" id=\"uf1b2ab8c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">在本指南中，您将使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4de2af8d\" id=\"u4de2af8d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/datasets/ought/raft\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc8f9f120\" id=\"uc8f9f120\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f4182a2\" id=\"u5f4182a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">RAFT</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub194271f\" id=\"ub194271f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uac710bd0\" id=\"uac710bd0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">数据集的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1c6dda5c\" id=\"u1c6dda5c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5f6b18d1\" id=\"u5f6b18d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5502f19\" id=\"uf5502f19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">twitter_complaints</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud6e56d57\" id=\"ud6e56d57\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9da15f1e\" id=\"u9da15f1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">子集。</span><code data-lake-id=\"uea0b0f94\" id=\"uea0b0f94\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e57131e\" id=\"u1e57131e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">twitter_complaints</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uae07a2d9\" id=\"uae07a2d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u33284b66\" id=\"u33284b66\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">子集包含标记为</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua6c2e50d\" id=\"ua6c2e50d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u745ef3b6\" id=\"u745ef3b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4f29139\" id=\"ue4f29139\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">complaint</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua8b3ccd4\" id=\"ua8b3ccd4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ud4012b9e\" id=\"ud4012b9e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"udf95909d\" id=\"udf95909d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub2ca5401\" id=\"ub2ca5401\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6020a57d\" id=\"u6020a57d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">no complaint</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u378fb097\" id=\"u378fb097\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ue6378e1a\" id=\"ue6378e1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">的推文，您可以查看</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/datasets/ought/raft/viewer/twitter_complaints\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u8400e2c8\" id=\"u8400e2c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bbaa2a7\" id=\"u3bbaa2a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">数据集查看器</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u51be99ca\" id=\"u51be99ca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，以更好地了解数据的外观。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7d6b4b1b\" id=\"u7d6b4b1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc48bc813\" id=\"uc48bc813\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u42010c1e\" id=\"u42010c1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/datasets/v3.4.1/en/package_reference/loading_methods#datasets.load_dataset\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud1e493b0\" id=\"ud1e493b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5482a75a\" id=\"u5482a75a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">load_dataset</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u69094ea6\" id=\"u69094ea6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc40bc020\" id=\"uc40bc020\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数加载数据集并创建一个新的</span><span data-lake-id=\"udfeadc14\" id=\"udfeadc14\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u228f0490\" id=\"u228f0490\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e143cc1\" id=\"u6e143cc1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">text_label</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8e4b7944\" id=\"u8e4b7944\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ud5b348d6\" id=\"ud5b348d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">列，以便更容易理解</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0402d9a9\" id=\"u0402d9a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7c9c30f7\" id=\"u7c9c30f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dc55380\" id=\"u1dc55380\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">Label</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc5dfeec1\" id=\"uc5dfeec1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ufbb7c634\" id=\"ufbb7c634\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">值</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4faef8d3\" id=\"u4faef8d3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3ae47d9d\" id=\"u3ae47d9d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue203733d\" id=\"ue203733d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">1</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2a4d9295\" id=\"u2a4d9295\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u20be3a7b\" id=\"u20be3a7b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"u08e57801\" id=\"u08e57801\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u725b903f\" id=\"u725b903f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50caf0b0\" id=\"u50caf0b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">2</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8b6fe597\" id=\"u8b6fe597\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub94443fa\" id=\"ub94443fa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">的含义。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20datasets%20import%20load_dataset%5Cn%5Cnds%20%3D%20load_dataset(%5C%22ought%2Fraft%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22twitter_complaints%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnclasses%20%3D%20%5Bk.replace(%5C%22_%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%20%5C%22)%20for%20k%20in%20ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.features%5B%5C%22Label%5C%22%5D.names%5D%5Cnds%20%3D%20ds.map(%5Cn%20%20%20%20lambda%20x%3A%20%7B%5C%22text_label%5C%22%3A%20%5Bclasses%5Blabel%5D%20for%20label%20in%20x%5B%5C%22Label%5C%22%5D%5D%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20batched%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_proc%3D1%2C%5Cn)%5Cnds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5B0%5D%5Cn%7B%5C%22Tweet%20text%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%40HMRCcustomers%20No%20this%20is%20my%20first%20job%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22ID%5C%22%3A%200%2C%20%5C%22Label%5C%22%3A%202%2C%20%5C%22text_label%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22no%20complaint%5C%22%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CWKi8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u05fda5a5\" id=\"u05fda5a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1db075de\" id=\"u1db075de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">加载分词器，定义要使用的填充 token，并确定分词后标签的最大长度。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2Fbloomz-560m%5C%22)%5Cnif%20tokenizer.pad_token_id%20is%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20tokenizer.pad_token_id%20%3D%20tokenizer.eos_token_id%5Cntarget_max_length%20%3D%20max(%5Blen(tokenizer(class_label)%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D)%20for%20class_label%20in%20classes%5D)%5Cnprint(target_max_length)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CW1jP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u98d96aff\" id=\"u98d96aff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u434ee9e0\" id=\"u434ee9e0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">创建一个预处理函数，该函数对推文文本和标签进行分词，填充每个批次的输入和标签，创建注意力掩码，并将序列截断为</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4da2fc53\" id=\"u4da2fc53\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc220cf8b\" id=\"uc220cf8b\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfc3a09d\" id=\"udfc3a09d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">max_length</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ube40b3b7\" id=\"ube40b3b7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。然后将</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua9145f9e\" id=\"ua9145f9e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf4b1dda8\" id=\"uf4b1dda8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c17a33e\" id=\"u4c17a33e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">input_ids</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf0022bd6\" id=\"uf0022bd6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u852a6b2a\" id=\"u852a6b2a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1d45262\" id=\"ub1d45262\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">attention_mask</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud89b52d5\" id=\"ud89b52d5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ud58e845e\" id=\"ud58e845e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"u21099660\" id=\"u21099660\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud68ae109\" id=\"ud68ae109\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb2e600a\" id=\"ubb2e600a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">labels</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u99d54af7\" id=\"u99d54af7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u779b11d0\" id=\"u779b11d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">转换为 PyTorch 张量。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cn%5Cnmax_length%20%3D%2064%5Cn%5Cndef%20preprocess_function(examples%2C%20text_column%3D%5C%22Tweet%20text%5C%22%2C%20label_column%3D%5C%22text_label%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20batch_size%20%3D%20len(examples%5Btext_column%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20inputs%20%3D%20%5Bf%5C%22%7Btext_column%7D%20%3A%20%7Bx%7D%20Label%20%3A%20%5C%22%20for%20x%20in%20examples%5Btext_column%5D%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20targets%20%3D%20%5Bstr(x)%20for%20x%20in%20examples%5Blabel_column%5D%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_inputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(inputs)%5Cn%20%20%20%20labels%20%3D%20tokenizer(targets)%5Cn%20%20%20%20classes%20%3D%20%5Bk.replace(%5C%22_%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%20%5C%22)%20for%20k%20in%20ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.features%5B%5C%22Label%5C%22%5D.names%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(batch_size)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sample_input_ids%20%3D%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20label_input_ids%20%3D%20labels%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20%5Btokenizer.pad_token_id%5D%20*%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20max_length%20-%20len(sample_input_ids)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%20%2B%20sample_input_ids%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22attention_mask%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20%5B0%5D%20*%20(max_length%20-%20len(sample_input_ids))%20%2B%20model_inputs%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22attention_mask%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5D%5Bi%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20labels%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20%5B-100%5D%20*%20(max_length%20-%20len(label_input_ids))%20%2B%20label_input_ids%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20torch.tensor(model_inputs%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%5B%3Amax_length%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22attention_mask%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20torch.tensor(model_inputs%5B%5C%22attention_mask%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%5B%3Amax_length%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20labels%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20torch.tensor(labels%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Bi%5D%5B%3Amax_length%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_inputs%5B%5C%22labels%5C%22%5D%20%3D%20labels%5B%5C%22input_ids%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20model_inputs%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zxI2R%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua354655b\" id=\"ua354655b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue941885c\" id=\"ue941885c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf7b64741\" id=\"uf7b64741\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/datasets/v3.4.1/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.Dataset.map\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u108756dc\" id=\"u108756dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9a386ab\" id=\"ud9a386ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">map</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub933a8ac\" id=\"ub933a8ac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uf7e30d2e\" id=\"uf7e30d2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数将预处理函数应用于整个数据集，并删除未处理的列，因为模型不需要它们。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22processed_ds%20%3D%20ds.map(%5Cn%20%20%20%20preprocess_function%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20batched%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_proc%3D1%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20remove_columns%3Dds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.column_names%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20load_from_cache_file%3DFalse%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20desc%3D%5C%22Running%20tokenizer%20on%20dataset%5C%22%2C%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UHMYx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue38f7ba2\" id=\"ue38f7ba2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91f9c883\" id=\"u91f9c883\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">最后，创建一个训练和评估</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3d3f4597\" id=\"u3d3f4597\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://pytorch.ac.cn/docs/stable/data.html#torch.utils.data.DataLoader\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub0e398a4\" id=\"ub0e398a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6c48abf\" id=\"ue6c48abf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">DataLoader</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8fc54bae\" id=\"u8fc54bae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。如果数据集中的样本位于 CPU 上，您可以设置</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8818b029\" id=\"u8818b029\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue8af9462\" id=\"ue8af9462\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c2fe1b5\" id=\"u3c2fe1b5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">pin_memory=True</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u095bacab\" id=\"u095bacab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u21e485e8\" id=\"u21e485e8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">以加速训练期间数据传输到 GPU 的速度。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20torch.utils.data%20import%20DataLoader%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20default_data_collator%5Cn%5Cntrain_ds%20%3D%20processed_ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5Cneval_ds%20%3D%20processed_ds%5B%5C%22test%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cnbatch_size%20%3D%2016%5Cn%5Cntrain_dataloader%20%3D%20DataLoader(train_ds%2C%20shuffle%3DTrue%2C%20collate_fn%3Ddefault_data_collator%2C%20batch_size%3Dbatch_size%2C%20pin_memory%3DTrue)%5Cneval_dataloader%20%3D%20DataLoader(eval_ds%2C%20collate_fn%3Ddefault_data_collator%2C%20batch_size%3Dbatch_size%2C%20pin_memory%3DTrue)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jMEcB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"n3qdk\" id=\"n3qdk\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d676b2a\" id=\"u2d676b2a\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u7db16f8d\" id=\"u7db16f8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue84a3cab\" id=\"ue84a3cab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">现在让我们加载一个预训练模型，用作软提示方法的基础模型。本指南使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0064b10a\" id=\"u0064b10a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/bigscience/bloomz-560m\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u8050f098\" id=\"u8050f098\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b27bcf3\" id=\"u3b27bcf3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">bigscience/bloomz-560m</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u48587ef0\" id=\"u48587ef0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc220d544\" id=\"uc220d544\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">模型，但您可以使用任何您想要的因果语言模型。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2Fbloomz-560m%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UBZo1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"RYklY\" id=\"RYklY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14e34aec\" id=\"u14e34aec\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">PEFT 配置和模型</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ueac48846\" id=\"ueac48846\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3be21005\" id=\"u3be21005\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">对于任何 PEFT 方法，您都需要创建一个配置，其中包含指定应如何应用 PEFT 方法的所有参数。配置设置完成后，将其与基础模型一起传递给</span><span data-lake-id=\"uca3ed2a1\" id=\"uca3ed2a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.get_peft_model\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u33317fad\" id=\"u33317fad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u297ad200\" id=\"u297ad200\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">get_peft_model()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7ec99811\" id=\"u7ec99811\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucb324c6f\" id=\"ucb324c6f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数，以创建一个可训练的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5b2506cc\" id=\"u5b2506cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u463e20f2\" id=\"u463e20f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb22d6e1\" id=\"ufb22d6e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ubce6c165\" id=\"ubce6c165\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u16760bee\" id=\"u16760bee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c8a9cff\" id=\"u6c8a9cff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">调用 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel.print_trainable_parameters\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u55c7a09e\" id=\"u55c7a09e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02c1e451\" id=\"u02c1e451\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">print_trainable_parameters()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5c9692e4\" id=\"u5c9692e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> 方法来比较 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0e2f8704\" id=\"u0e2f8704\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea51688e\" id=\"uea51688e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ube4b8de3\" id=\"ube4b8de3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> 的可训练参数数量与基础模型中的参数数量！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u31ead746\" id=\"u31ead746\"><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/prompting#p-tuning\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9af28a67\" id=\"u9af28a67\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf44651b\" id=\"ucf44651b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">P-tuning</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u06ffdb61\" id=\"u06ffdb61\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u6e4b9dbd\" id=\"u6e4b9dbd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">添加了一个可训练的嵌入张量，其中 prompt tokens 可以添加到输入序列中的任何位置。创建一个</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud2b2cc8a\" id=\"ud2b2cc8a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/p_tuning#peft.PromptEncoderConfig\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u49314310\" id=\"u49314310\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f5bb38b\" id=\"u7f5bb38b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PromptEncoderConfig</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ua6b73ccc\" id=\"ua6b73ccc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，其中包含任务类型、要添加和学习的虚拟 token 数量以及用于学习 prompt 参数的编码器隐藏层大小。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20PromptEncoderConfig%2C%20get_peft_model%5Cn%5Cnpeft_config%20%3D%20PromptEncoderConfig(task_type%3D%5C%22CAUSAL_LM%5C%22%2C%20num_virtual_tokens%3D20%2C%20encoder_hidden_size%3D128)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20get_peft_model(model%2C%20peft_config)%5Cnmodel.print_trainable_parameters()%5Cn%5C%22trainable%20params%3A%20300%2C288%20%7C%7C%20all%20params%3A%20559%2C514%2C880%20%7C%7C%20trainable%25%3A%200.05366935013417338%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BxwVt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"mIBaO\" id=\"mIBaO\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07f32554\" id=\"u07f32554\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">训练</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u88fdeb62\" id=\"u88fdeb62\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6072cabd\" id=\"u6072cabd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">设置优化器和学习率调度器。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20get_linear_schedule_with_warmup%5Cn%5Cnlr%20%3D%203e-2%5Cnnum_epochs%20%3D%2050%5Cn%5Cnoptimizer%20%3D%20torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters()%2C%20lr%3Dlr)%5Cnlr_scheduler%20%3D%20get_linear_schedule_with_warmup(%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer%3Doptimizer%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_warmup_steps%3D0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_training_steps%3D(len(train_dataloader)%20*%20num_epochs)%2C%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22flFhs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf6a765c2\" id=\"uf6a765c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua17de728\" id=\"ua17de728\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">将模型移动到 GPU，并创建一个训练循环，报告每个 epoch 的损失和困惑度。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20tqdm%20import%20tqdm%5Cn%5Cndevice%20%3D%20%5C%22cuda%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20model.to(device)%5Cn%5Cnfor%20epoch%20in%20range(num_epochs)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20model.train()%5Cn%20%20%20%20total_loss%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20step%2C%20batch%20in%20enumerate(tqdm(train_dataloader))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20batch%20%3D%20%7Bk%3A%20v.to(device)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20batch.items()%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model(**batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20outputs.loss%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20total_loss%20%2B%3D%20loss.detach().float()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss.backward()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lr_scheduler.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20model.eval()%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_loss%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_preds%20%3D%20%5B%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20step%2C%20batch%20in%20enumerate(tqdm(eval_dataloader))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20batch%20%3D%20%7Bk%3A%20v.to(device)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20batch.items()%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20with%20torch.no_grad()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model(**batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20outputs.loss%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20eval_loss%20%2B%3D%20loss.detach().float()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20eval_preds.extend(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tokenizer.batch_decode(torch.argmax(outputs.logits%2C%20-1).detach().cpu().numpy()%2C%20skip_special_tokens%3DTrue)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_epoch_loss%20%3D%20eval_loss%20%2F%20len(eval_dataloader)%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_ppl%20%3D%20torch.exp(eval_epoch_loss)%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_epoch_loss%20%3D%20total_loss%20%2F%20len(train_dataloader)%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_ppl%20%3D%20torch.exp(train_epoch_loss)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bepoch%3D%7D%3A%20%7Btrain_ppl%3D%7D%20%7Btrain_epoch_loss%3D%7D%20%7Beval_ppl%3D%7D%20%7Beval_epoch_loss%3D%7D%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WYF93%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"vdd03\" id=\"vdd03\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45af6d61\" id=\"u45af6d61\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">分享您的模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uad4e1079\" id=\"uad4e1079\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80b9b0ff\" id=\"u80b9b0ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">训练完成后，您可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u656b3ef1\" id=\"u656b3ef1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/model#transformers.PreTrainedModel.push_to_hub\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9ba0d08f\" id=\"u9ba0d08f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u091226ef\" id=\"u091226ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">push_to_hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7e57647d\" id=\"u7e57647d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u32e00dab\" id=\"u32e00dab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法将您的模型上传到 Hub。您需要先登录您的 Hugging Face 帐户，并在提示时输入您的 token。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20huggingface_hub%20import%20notebook_login%5Cn%5Cnaccount%20%3D%20%3Cyour-hf-account-name%3E%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20f%5C%22%7Baccount%7D%2Fbloomz-560-m-peft-method%5C%22%5Cnmodel.push_to_hub(peft_model_id)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WgeBR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9b4592db\" id=\"u9b4592db\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucaed058f\" id=\"ucaed058f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">如果您检查存储库中的模型文件大小，您会发现它比完整大小的模型小得多！</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1904, "description": "示例代码prompt-causal.zip前言Prompt 可以描述一个任务，或者提供您希望模型学习的任务示例。软提示方法不是手动创建这些 prompt，而是在输入嵌入中添加可学习的参数，这些参数可以针对特定任务进行优化，同时保持预训练模型的参数冻结。这使得为新的下游任务微调大型语言模型 (L...", "updated_at": "2025-05-07T02:22:07.000Z", "created_at": "2025-05-07T01:44:17.000Z", "id": 218477502, "status": 1}